    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one day, you were reincarnated into a Galgame and became the heroine, what would you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullied by hooligans, perverted old men, and goblins? No, I'm going to hit back hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too weak? Don't worry, use the power granted by the goddess and embark on an adventure in this peril-ridden alternate world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Magic shooting: The protagonist will use various magic bullets, skills, and melee attacks to attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Cruel Enemies: With a vast number of monsters in the maze, can you survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Day and night alternation/Gathering and Alchemy: A realistic day and night alternation system, gathering and alchemy system, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one day, you were reincarnated into a Galgame and became the heroine, what would you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullied by hooligans, perverted old men, and goblins? No, I'm going to hit back hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too weak? Don't worry, use the power granted by the goddess and embark on an adventure in this peril-ridden alternate world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Magic shooting: The protagonist will use various magic bullets, skills, and melee attacks to attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Cruel Enemies: With a vast number of monsters in the maze, can you survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Day and night alternation/Gathering and Alchemy: A realistic day and night alternation system, gathering and alchemy system, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
